[SECTION]
UID: SEC-MCP
TITLE: MCP agent desks
STATEMENT: >>>
MCP agents authenticate like UI users, bind to a requirements desk (browser tab routing), mutate via HTTPS API, and receive live desk pushes on a session-sealed WebSocket.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
KIND: section
LEVEL: 1
VERSION_UID: SEC-MCP
STATUS: active
<<<

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: MC01
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: MCP authenticate session & desk bind
STATEMENT: >>>
An MCP host connects to ReqAML MCP (stdio or Streamable HTTP), establishes a platform session (OAuth opaque token or login aligned with A01), lists desks, and attach/detach routing to a browser requirements desk; live pushes use session-sealed WSS.
<<<
